### Minetur API (Spain)
### Official fuel prices for all stations in Spain
### Docs: https://sedeaplicaciones.minetur.gob.es/ServiciosRESTCarburantes/PreciosCarburantes/help

@baseUrl = https://sedeaplicaciones.minetur.gob.es/ServiciosRESTCarburantes/PreciosCarburantes

### Get all terrestrial stations in Spain (Large response ~5-10MB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/EstacionesTerrestres/
Accept: application/json

### Get fuel prices by Province (e.g. Madrid = 28)
@provinceId = 28
GET {{baseUrl}}/EstacionesTerrestres/FiltroProvincia/{{provinceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get fuel prices by Municipality (e.g. Madrid city = 4354)
@municipalityId = 4354
GET {{baseUrl}}/EstacionesTerrestres/FiltroMunicipio/{{municipalityId}}
Accept: application/json

### List of all products (fuels)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ListadoProductos/
Accept: application/json
